"entity": {
"name": "Clarivate PLC",
"description": "Clarivate Plc engages in the provision of global information, analytics, and workflow solutions. It operates through the following segments: Academia and Government (A&G), Intellectual Property (IP), and Life Sciences and Healthcare (LS&H). The A&G segment involves the provision of research and analytics, content aggregation, and workflow software solutions using artificial intelligence. The IP segment includes the maintenance, intelligence, and management solutions. The LS&H focuses on solutions for research and development, regulatory and safety, and commercialization. The company was founded in 1864 and is headquartered in London, the United Kingdom.",
